<Base
  title="About. Reput8ion Dynamics"
  description="The practice: narrative, issues management, communications training and reputation counsel, underwritten by three decades of crisis experience."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <SampleTag label="Sample structure and register. Final copy is James with Opus assist, 500 to 700 words" />
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      When Kerry Group divested its consumer foods business and had to explain
      what it now was, the external account of that repositioning ran through
      one communications director. That is the kind of work this practice does.
    </p>

    <p>
      Reput8ion Dynamics is led by James Dunny. Nearly thirty years at senior
      practitioner level: External Communications Director at Kerry Group, Head
      of Crisis Management EMEA at FleishmanHillard, Fellow of the PRII,
      elected February 2026.
    </p>

    <p>
      The work is narrative development, issues management, communications
      training, corporate strategy, reputation counsel and leadership
      positioning. Crisis experience underwrites all of it. Three decades of
      being in the room when it went wrong is why the counsel holds when it
      matters, and it is the reason a chair takes the call about a narrative
      problem or a training programme. It is not what most clients are buying.
      It is the evidence that the judgement has been tested.
    </p>

    <p>
      Reputation is built over years and lost in moments. The difference is
      the quality of counsel you have in the room.
    </p>

    <p>
      Good communications counsel is not about managing messages. It is about
      managing reality, and helping leaders understand the difference.
    </p>

    <p>
      Two commitments shape how the practice works. What we produce is built
      to be used: positions that can be held, narratives that can be spoken,
      preparation that survives contact. We do not produce reports that sit on
      shelves. And the level of counsel you need is the level you receive.
      Every engagement is led directly by James, with specialist associates
      where the situation requires.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

